# Secrets and per-host config
.env
**/.env
*/*/.env

# Tesseract relayer config — carries signer secrets in the clear, because Tesseract does
# not expand environment variables. Only the .example template belongs in the repo.
**/relayer.toml

# TLS material (Cloudflare Origin Certificate)
origin.pem
origin.key

# Chain-spec generation intermediates
**/spec-plain.json
**/spec-customized.json
